  "text": "Possess: pick a creature you killed from your archive and play it while this permanent stands (your character stands still, Empty Posture / Empty Move). No creature in your archive: the Phylactery permanent instead — click it to destroy the most valuable permanent of the nearest enemy (inactive with no enemy or no permanent near).",
  "flags": {
    "permanent": true,
    "scope": "self",
    "possess": true,
    "fixedPower": 6
  },
  "ui": {
    "perm_help": "Possess / Phylactery (6) — Possess: you play the creature it brought in from your archive (your action and target drive it; your hero holds with Empty Posture) until this permanent is destroyed (the creature leaves, its card back to your archive) or the creature dies. Phylactery (Possess cast with no creature in your archive): click it — the most valuable permanent (highest power) of the nearest enemy within 2 hexes shatters at this action's end, then the Phylactery is spent; greyed = no enemy with a permanent in reach"
