      "text": "Possess: pick a creature you killed from your archive and play it while this permanent stands (your character stands still, Empty Posture / Empty Move). No creature in your archive: the Phylactery permanent instead — click it to destroy the most valuable permanent of the nearest enemy (inactive with no enemy or no permanent near).",
